{
  "about": "Code's billing request as every layer must read it: ezil-models sendBillingIntent, the workbench `billing-intent` patch, the Worker billing bridge (worker/src/code-billing-bridge.ts) and the shell receiver (shell/ezil/ui/Settings/billing-recovery.js). Each layer's tests run these same records. `accept` pairs a record with the intent the bridge posts and the shell keeps (`expect`), so the bridge's output is the shell's input unchanged; every `reject` record is dropped by the patch, the bridge and the shell. resetsAt is Date.prototype.toISOString form and only travels with window_limit.",
  "accept": [
